          "before": "The user input is serialized as a canonical JSON object with one `query` field. XGrammar 0.2.1 requires exactly five strings; validation rejects empty, duplicate, or placeholder passages. Invalid output is retried once with the same seed and validation feedback, then falls back to the unexpanded query.",
